pia6821: Motorola MC6821 PIA. Own work (Rodimus). The source header says "Interface and timing after John E. Kent's
pia6821.vhd" (System09): the port list and access timing follow that core; no code from it is known to be carried.
Behaviour is checked against MAME src/devices/machine/6821pia.cpp (BSD-3-Clause).

Note: whether any of Kent's VHDL was translated line-for-line is not recorded. If it was, add his attribution and
licence terms here.

